config H2_ESP_NET_BOUNDED_CLOSE
    bool
    default y
    select LWIP_SO_LINGER
    help
        Net provisions zero-linger cleanup before a bounded TLS attempt. Only
        unsuccessful or canceled bounded handshakes retain abortive close;
        ordinary sockets and successfully published TLS restore normal linger.

config H2_ESP_NET_DEFERRED_INIT
    bool
    default y
    select FREERTOS_USE_TIMERS
    help
        Net polls may request finite static executor recovery through the SDK
        timer service. Its queue exists before application task execution.
        TLS setup, native close and destruction remain on Net-owned tasks.
